{"name":"Supreme Furnace","category":"supreme_crafting:blocks","icon":"supreme_crafting:supreme_furnace_casing","pages":[{"type":"patchouli:text","text":"An oversized vanilla furnace. Build a hollow cube of $(item)Supreme Furnace Casing$(), wrench any wall to form. Three valid sizes: $(l)32x32x32$() smelts 1 item per tick, $(l)64x64x64$() smelts 8 per tick, $(l)128x128x128$() smelts a full stack (64) per tick. Each smelt costs 4x more fuel-ticks than a vanilla furnace \u2014 bigger sizes need proportionally more fuel input."},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"Fuel","text":"Fuel accumulates in the bank: a stick alone is not enough for one smelt, but 8 sticks accumulate to one. One coal smelts 2 items. The bigger furnaces drain the bank 8x and 64x faster respectively \u2014 you will need coal blocks or lava buckets at the larger tiers."},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"Hatches & Terminal","text":"Swap any casing for an $(item)Input$(), $(item)Output$(), or $(item)Fuel Hatch$() before forming for pipe-based automation. The $(item)Supreme Furnace Terminal$() binds to any wall on right-click and lets you access the furnace remotely from any dimension."},{"type":"patchouli:multiblock","name":"Supreme Furnace (32\u00b3)","multiblock":{"mapping":{"0":"supreme_crafting:supreme_furnace_casing","#":"supreme_crafting:supreme_furnace_casing"},"pattern":[["################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","################################","###